    "Nansen was not connected. smartWalletCount and kolCount are null so the UI shows an em dash; never write 0 to mean missing.",
    "Ages on smartFlows are as GMGN displayed them at capture, not live-updating ages. First-pass tape ages are as of about 6:19 PM ET; scroll-pass ages (the later complete view for cards that reappeared) are as of about 6:35 PM ET.",
    "Price was not displayed on the GMGN Solana 1h trending table, so price is null for every row. Trending #1 had no separate ticker on the table; the symbol is the backpack emoji GMGN used for the same contract (DYsj...pump) on the Smart Inflow tape.",
    "Token Info badge mapping was verified by hovering row 1. Line 1: an unlabeled first badge (InsightX / BubbleMaps / Faster100X links; recorded only in these notes, not as top10Pct or insiderPct), then Dev (house; DS = Dev Sell All, otherwise a Dev hold %), Insiders (person), Bundlers (package). Line 2: Phishing (bug), Snipers (crosshair), paid status (Unpaid / $299 / $299 CTO), then the holders-count / top-10 percentage badge (e.g. 193 / 29.47%).",
