    "The per-wallet tape was captured from GMGN's 1h Smart Inflow table (Monitor > Smart / Callout at https://gmgn.ai/monitor?chain=sol&tab=smartdegen), not from token-level S-Flow aggregates. The left-rail Smart Degen mini feed was not used as the tape. The board is live and reorders; for each contract the later complete first-pass/scroll view was kept. Cards that appeared only on the first 6:19 PM ET screenshot and never again (MOON 3PNQ…qboA, TAIL 2tHP…pump, moonbag GQZt…pump) were added from that screenshot. TAIL and moonbag full CAs were not visible (truncated on the card), so they are not stored as tokenAddress. AVGOx CA is XsgSaSvNSqLTtFuyWPBhK9196Xb9Bbdyjj4fH3cPJGo; CSI CA is 6EHTywfoXpDNhL4JGkeYUhiL6mumpmD7j8ByjQaXpump.",
    "walletFull values were not present on the token-card wallet rows (no href). Full base58 addresses were taken from the left-rail Smart Degen feed wallet links (/sol/address/<FULL>) and applied only when the truncated label matched exactly; unmatched wallets have no walletFull. Named labels such as SP, Enxgma, Cupsey, ozark, MrNobody, MoldovaMan and Musa were stored as GMGN showed them.",
